      "content": "It's important to consult a healthcare provider before combining st John's wort with any medication, including birth control pills. St John's wort can interfere with the effectiveness of many medications, potentially decreasing the birth control's efficacy and leading to unintended pregnancies. They can also lead to changes in side effects. Seeking advice from a doctor or pharmacist will get you the most accurate guidance for your situation.",
